.md, add due/start to the Rust rows, apply the recurring [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]overlay, queue order, counts, schema 11 CLI output, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recurring_undated lint, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-ledger-tools evaluator, footer, and freshness namespace v9[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger[dim] · [dim][/dim]after rust[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger: mirror the RECURRING overlay, ordering, and counts in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-ledger-tools, add the RECUR footer group and entry view, publish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]freshness namespace v9 with recurringTier, and pin the RC vectors in JS [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation Hotkeys tier handling and recurring answers[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav: teach bob-navigation-hotkeys the recurring tier (labels, commitment[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]set, notices), the Alt+F / Ctrl+Alt+F recurring answer, and which [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gestures resolve a recurring landing, with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install, deploy, vault closeout text, memory, and live check[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after rust, ledger, nav[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: install bob, sync plugins, verify the live vault's overdue [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recurring rows walk in RECURRING, adjust the Morning review text, apply [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]or defer the memory changes, and leave Bryan a checklist.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5p","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_